#undef NDEBUG
// Review GS: the temporal profile and its conformance on a CSV upload's frame
// shapes (format_dataframe(read_csv) with the file's first three columns, or
// its Polars lazy frame).
//
// - Polars resolves the pair frame's plan over the frame's dtypes: a start
//   column of numbers, text or Booleans beside the dates fails with the plan
//   (or, with business hours, the UDF's SchemaError once a pair passes the
//   filter); the conformance lists each case's deviations in pair order.
// - pandas with the timestamp as its own start measures text pairs only
//   once one passes the filter, refuses a Boolean subtraction of any length,
//   and with business hours measures row by row (no pair: the empty frame's
//   ValueError, in the conformance before the profile is read).
// - A Boolean column with a gap is an object column of Python bools in
//   pandas (each present pair's start compared with the dates) and text in
//   Polars' copy.
//
// Expected values are pm4py 2.7.22 black-box on the same inputs
// (review-harness round-gs: tc/mkgs.py, ct/tpdcsv.py, ct/tpccsv.py).
//
// Usage: minera_server_review_gs_tests <minera_server>

